{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Gumball and his friends in the mysterious realm of Trick-or-Treat Land in this 8-hour JRPG adventure. Engage in competitive TRICK-OR-TREATING with a unique cast of characters. Cast spells, brew potions, and save the land from the wicked forces of chaos! This game is a love letter to the Game Boy Color era and will send you straight back to 1998.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a single-player campaign in which you explore an immersive overworld and challenge the inhabitants in quirky, turn-based combat. While you'll face some tough opponents, most of the characters are generally pretty chill and will be willing to speak with you in the form of hints, quips, or general non sequiturs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most of the overworld puzzles are fairly straightforward, but you'll have to pay attention to the dialogue in order to progress through the story. The main challenges lie in turn-based combat, which will test your strategic management of HP and Magickal resources against a variety of opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640330/extras/Combat.png?t=1745102166\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640330/extras/Gusp.png?t=1745102166\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640330/extras/Book.png?t=1745102166\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640330?t=1745102166","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640330?t=1745102166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640330/2ae7c60e0890902a9023041f08d8ab9fb2888409/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745102166","capsule_imagev5